      "sourceTextSha256": "c52712b3cf0222f0faea1b1673c22c2c9727b4d23c7b7c7689a27987ecdf2526",
      "text": "Enjoy a full week, without rushing, through Guatemala's principal highlights, from indigenous markets and the legendary Lake Atitlán to the colonial streets of Antigua and the Maya city of Tikal, before crossing into Belize to unwind on the beautiful island of Ambergris Caye (San Pedro).\n\nSaturdays (regular) · daily (private)",
